  "reason": "The exact 256x128 opaque-diamond alpha contract passes with 16,384 alpha-255 interior pixels, 16,384 alpha-0 exterior pixels, no partial alpha, and zero chroma/exterior residue. The amber accent is a short, narrow, irregular interior vein with variable width and tapered ends; both endpoints stop well before the quiet rim, it has no contrasting shoulder, and it neither divides the tile nor reads as a route or tiling seam. The off-center cool mineral-stained island is flat and diffuse with no discrete stones, raised rubble, cast shadow, or obstacle semantics. Broad low-contrast limestone and generous quiet ground remain readable beneath overlays, with no grid, stripe, repeated stamp, forest content, text, framing, or visible defect.",
